{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Undead Onslaught Official Soundtrack \u2013 Support the Darkness! \ud83d\udd25</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Undead Onslaught Soundtrack</strong> is more than just a collection of dark, pulse-pounding tracks\u2014it\u2019s a way to <strong>support the ongoing development of the game!</strong> Given the base game's <strong>very low price</strong>, this pack serves as an optional way for our most dedicated villains to contribute to our continued work on the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>What\u2019s Included?</strong><br>\ud83c\udfb5 A growing collection of <strong>haunting, blood-pumping</strong> tracks from the game.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 All new character themes will be <strong>added for free</strong> as updates roll out.<br>\ud83c\udfbc Tracks may <strong>evolve, improve, and be refined</strong> alongside the game itself.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Future updates will include new content <strong>within 1-2 weeks</strong> of each major game update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Want to listen for free?</strong> The full soundtrack will be released on <strong>Spotify</strong> <strong>no less than a year</strong> after its launch on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting <strong>Undead Onslaught</strong>\u2014your support fuels the darkness. \ud83d\udda4\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583030?t=1742500115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583030?t=1742500115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583030/a510a97a07b9bb2409c38b0f69fe0f2ff18d13cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742500115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583030/a510a97a07b9bb2409c38b0f69fe0f2ff18d13cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742500115","content_descrip